 as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","no-global-assign","no-unsafe-negation"]